  // So in PyTorch conv_transpose, weight shape is [in_channels, out_channels/groups, KH, KW]
  // StableHLO convolution expects rhs shape: [KH, KW, in_channels/groups, out_channels]
  // So we need to transpose weight from [8,8,3,3] to [3,3,8,8]
