  // We want to broadcast to [8x8x8x8], so broadcast_dimensions=[1], input shape [8], output shape [8x8x8x8]
  // So we use broadcast_in_dim with broadcast_dimensions=[1], input shape [8], output shape [8x8x8x8]
  // But stablehlo.broadcast_in_dim does not have output shape attribute, so we rely on type inference.
