  // So we need to transpose weight dims 0 and 1 to get [out_channels, in_channels/groups, KH, KW]
  // Here out_channels = 8, in_channels = 8, groups=8, so in_channels/groups=1
  // So weight shape for conv: [8,1,3,3]
  // Our weight is [8,8,3,3], so we reshape and transpose dims 0 and 1.

  // Reshape flipped kernel to [8,8,3,3] -> [8,8,3,3] (no change)
  // Transpose dims 0 and 1: [8,8,3,3] -> [8,8,3,3]
