func.func @main(%arg0: tensor<16x16xf32>, %arg1: tensor<16xf32>, %arg2: tensor<16x16xf32>) -> tensor<16xf32> {
  // %arg2: input tensor (batch_size=16, in_features=16)
  // %arg0: weight matrix (16x16)
  // %arg1: bias vector (16)

  // 1) Linear layer: matmul + bias
  // According to dot_general syntax, batching dims must match on lhs and rhs if present.
  // Here input is (16,16), weight is (16,16), we want output (16,16)
  // So we treat batch dim as 0 on lhs, no batch dim on rhs, contracting dims lhs=1, rhs=0
  // But rhs_batching_dimensions must be empty or same size as lhs_batching_dimensions.
  // So we treat rhs as non-batched, lhs batch dim = 0, contracting dims lhs=1, rhs=0
  // This is valid.

